# --- Secrets: must never enter the build context ---
# Bare glob, deliberately with no negated exception. The image has no use for
# .env.example, and a single unambiguous rule removes any chance of an exception
# pattern accidentally re-admitting a real secrets file.
.env*

# --- Build artifacts (regenerated inside the image) ---
node_modules
dist
dist-server
.vite
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local

# --- VCS, tooling, docs ---
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
README.md
DEPLOY.md
.DS_Store

# --- Docker's own files ---
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
